Thanks for code and answer.

So the difference is this:

diagonal ->   Q+ I*eps, where eps is the diagonal value
whereas Cmatrix= R+I epsilon, means we consider Q = (R+I*eps)*tau
Here R is the so-called structure matrix, while Q= tau*R.

